  "accounting_notes": [
    "GPU-dependent subprocesses include startup, model loading and I/O. Ledger spans include CPU work and gaps between tasks. A utilization trace or provider invoice is needed for active-device seconds or a rental charge.",
    "Proxy training and trajectory scoring are paid once in the primary stage and reused by the later arms. Two full-pool checkpoints share one training run. The external baseline pilot appears once in the all-in total and is excluded from work started by the five stage controllers.",
    "Validation uses archived task receipts and ledgers. Training, development and test runtimes were also reconciled against independent terminal replays for all 11 Phase 1 models and all three E2b models. E2b reuses nine earlier comparison models and pays no additional proxy or trajectory-scoring time.",
    "Primary CPU selection was timed. Phase 1 selector construction and final CPU summarization had no ledger timers. Other CPU ledger tasks include only successfully timed subprocesses. Null means unavailable; a zero denotes no corresponding recorded work.",
    "The off_ledger_local_selector_routine_seconds value is elapsed wall time on a separate machine for the E2b selector using cached inputs across all three seeds. It is excluded from all job-ledger and GPU totals. The E2b stage had zero selector tasks in its GPU-host ledger."
